---
// Footer section with Primary Dark Green (#1E482C) and Pure White (#FFFFFF)
import { COMPANY_INFO } from '../data/companyInfo';

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-[#1E482C] text-slate-200 pt-16 pb-12 border-t border-white/10" aria-label="Footer Resmi AtasiLimbah">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-8 pb-12 border-b border-white/10">
      <!-- Column 1: Brand & Positioning (4 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#153620] border border-white/15 flex items-center justify-center text-white shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.38-.5-2-1-3-1.072-2.143-.224-4.054 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.153.433-2.294 1-3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
              ATASI<span class="text-white font-extrabold">LIMBAH</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-white/70">
              {COMPANY_INFO.legalName}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-white/80 leading-relaxed pr-2">
          Pusat rekayasa dan fabrikasi mesin incinerator dual chamber standar baku mutu emisi KLHK untuk pengolahan sampah mandiri institusi, komersial, dan industri.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-1">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#153620] border border-white/15 text-white text-xs font-semibold">
            Dual Chamber SNI
          </span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#153620] border border-white/15 text-white text-xs font-medium">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-white shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
            </svg>
            Standar Mutu KLHK P.70/2016
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-1 pt-2 text-xs text-white/80">
          <div>Hotline WhatsApp: <a href="#konsultasi" class="text-white hover:underline font-tech font-bold">0851-8300-5070</a></div>
          <div>Jam Operasional: Senin – Sabtu: 08.00 – 17.00 WIB</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: Katalog Mesin (2 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white font-tech">KATALOG MESIN</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs text-white/80">
          <li><a href="/mesin-incinerator/al-1000j/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Incinerator AL-1000J (1 Ton/Jam)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/mesin-incinerator/carbonizer-biochar-y23/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Karbonisasi Biochar AL-BIO23</a></li>
          <li><a href="/mesin-incinerator/al-b3-100j/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Incinerator B3 AL-B3-100J</a></li>
          <li><a href="/mesin-incinerator/al-1500h/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Incinerator AL-1500H</a></li>
          <li><a href="/mesin-incinerator/al-1000h/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Incinerator AL-1000H</a></li>
          <li><a href="/mesin-incinerator/al-200j/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Incinerator AL-200J</a></li>
          <li><a href="/mesin-incinerator/al-500h/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Incinerator AL-500H</a></li>
          <li class="pt-1">
            <a href="/mesin-incinerator/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] text-white hover:underline font-semibold gap-1">
              <span>Semua Produk</span>
              <span>&rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 3: Kategori Brief (3 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white font-tech">KATEGORI INCINERATOR</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs text-white/80">
          <li><a href="/incinerator-sampah-kering/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Incinerator Sampah Kering</a></li>
          <li><a href="/incinerator-sampah-basah/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Incinerator Sampah Basah</a></li>
          <li><a href="/incinerator-sampah-campuran/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Incinerator Sampah Campuran Non-B3</a></li>
          <li><a href="/incinerator-limbah-b3/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Incinerator Limbah B3</a></li>
          <li><a href="/incinerator-industri/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Incinerator Industri & Pabrik</a></li>
          <li><a href="/incinerator-custom/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Custom Incinerator System</a></li>
          <li><a href="/mesin-karbonisasi-biochar/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[28px] hover:text-white transition-colors">Mesin Karbonisasi Biochar</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 4: Pengiriman & Komisioning (3 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white font-tech">PENGIRIMAN & INSTALASI</h3>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#153620] border border-white/15 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-white">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
              <span>Pengiriman Seluruh Indonesia</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
              Melayani pengiriman ekspedisi logistik alat berat ke seluruh pulau di Indonesia dengan packing baja dan proteksi refractory.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#153620] border border-white/15 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-white">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 14 14"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Komisioning & Pelatihan On-Site</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
              Didampingi teknisi berpengalaman untuk uji bakar (*test burn*), setting pembakaran optimal, dan sertifikasi operator fasilitas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-white/70 gap-4">
      <p>&copy; {currentYear} {COMPANY_INFO.legalName}. Hak cipta dilindungi undang-undang.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs">
        <a href="/tentang-kami/" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Tentang Kami</a>
        <span>•</span>
        <a href="/kontak/" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Kontak</a>
        <span>•</span>
        <a href="/permintaan-penawaran/" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Permintaan SPH</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>